[37.795, "o", "\r\n"]
[38.595, "o", "\u001b[38;5;245m  The rollback ran the compensations in strict reverse of the commit order —\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[41.863, "o", "\u001b[38;5;245m  release inventory → refund → cancel order.  That's the Saga guarantee.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[44.959, "o", "\u001b[38;5;245m  Every byte above is real demo output — only the pacing is staged.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
